      "note": "Retail Emerald, FireRed and the Complete FireRed Upgrade hacks fail. Heart & Soul v2.0.6 fails too: it's built on pokeemerald-expansion 1.15.2, whose item entries hold name pointers, and its RHH header sits at 0x204, so 0x20C holds no pointer. Another hack on 1.9 to 1.12 with the same structures would pass, so the match is possible."
    }
